  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that for RNA-only models, multiprofile setups with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and avgpool aggregation achieve higher accuracy (0.650) than pca_n2000. This experiment tests whether switching to scgpt RNA encoder (a new representation) in the same multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation isolates the impact of the RNA encoder. This clarifies whether scgpt outperforms scvi_n200, a critical design choice with sparse prior evidence."
